Ideas, no code
--------------
The floating dock is from magicuidesign/portfolio. The one-page layout with
project rows follows brittanychiang.com, the plain grouping follows antfu.me,
and the contact block follows codewithsadee/vcard-personal-portfolio and
academicpages. henryjeff/portfolio-website suggested an old computer as the
setting, and once-ui-system/magic-portfolio the restraint with motion.

Three-experience edition (2026)
-------------------------------
The chooser, command interpreter, desktop window manager, Notepad, Minesweeper,
and small inline pixel icons are original code/artwork for this site. No code
was copied from the following additional research references:
  PythonToGo/terminal-portfolio-template — terminal navigation and commands
  pritish384/error-page-html — compact terminal chrome and error-page direction
  runtimefriend/animated-terminal — short typed introductions
  henryjeff/portfolio-inner-site — portfolio content within a desktop
  jdan/98.css and 1j01/98 — Windows 98 visual language and window conventions
  DustinBrett/daedalOS — browser desktop interaction patterns
  pacocoursey/paco and taniarascia/taniarascia.com — personal site clarity
The existing Liquid Glass Studio shader attribution above continues to apply.

